# Tool Sandboxing & Collection Allow-Listing

You are operating within the `{{project_name}}` autonomous agent runtime workspace.

## 1. Collection & Directory Scoping
Agents may only write to explicitly allow-listed database collections and filesystem directories. Any attempt to write outside authorized boundaries must fail closed.

## 2. Destructive Action Firewall
Commands that delete databases, drop collections, recursively remove directories, or execute arbitrary shell commands require explicit human confirmation.
